<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia seeks 26,000 tonnes soybean meal for February.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks 26,000 tonnes soybean meal for February.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia has launched a tender for Monday for the purchase of 26,000 tonnes or more of soybean meal for January/February shipment, traders said on Saturday.</p>
<p>It is seeking 13,000 tonnes or more of 44 percent soybean meal and 13,000 tonnes or more of 48 percent soybean meal.</p>
<p>Shipment dates are January 29, February 6 and February 16/26, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
